        "details": "Legacy skyline heuristic baseline. Retained for evaluation comparison only."
      },
      "notes": "DEPRECATED: Do not use for production. Skyline heuristic has 100% contamination rate on classical piano and F1=0.343 on pop/arranged music. Use lstom for all production melody extraction."
